''''''Brachypodium distachyon'''''', the '''purple false brome''', is a species of annual grass in the family [[Poaceae]] (true grasses). They have a self-supporting growth form and simple, broad leaves. Individuals can grow to 14&nbsp;cm tall.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Brachypodium distachyon (L.) P.Beauv. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/1114728|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|last=Mifsud|first=Stephen|date=2002-08-23|title=Brachypodium hybridum (Hybridous Mediterranean False Brome) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands.|url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/POAC/Brachypodium_hybridum.php|access-date=2022-02-07|website=www.maltawildplants.com|language=en-us}}</ref>

